      "content": "The feeling that you are just a background character is a common and heavy experience for new people, but it does not reflect the truth of your reality. While the objective world might haven't noticed you yet, the value of your presence—including the courage to share this pain—is already being acknowledged here. It is okay to pause and rest when the pressure to connect feels overwhelming, simply as long as you keep reaching out until your own silence begins to break.",
