      "content": "but \"pausing\" doesn't change anything. the silence is still there. it's just heavy. i keep thinking that if i really just let go, if i stopped fighting to exist in a place that doesn't want me, it would be a relief. like, if i'm already a ghost, does it even matter if i actually disappear?",
